WEBVTT

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.730 line:95%,end
The cooperation with PubliX helps us handle the challenges we face,

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:06.650 line:95%,end
when it comes to growth, for example.

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:10.030 line:95%,end
They help us with support systems for administrators,

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:13.643 line:95%,end
they help us with marketing, they help us with recruitment –

00:00:13.643 --> 00:00:16.230 line:95%,end
which can be very challenging for smaller companies.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:22.140 line:95%,end
At the same time, they support us a great deal with AI.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:32.160 line:95%,end
As CEO, it matters a lot to me that PubliX, as owner, invests in our people.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:36.820 line:95%,end
With the support and help we get from PubliX, I feel confident

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:39.740 line:95%,end
that we will reach the goals we have set.
